abstract: >-
  An AI-assisted, research-informed guide to choosing, building, evaluating,
  and presenting an AI or machine learning engineering portfolio. It includes
  two flagship project briefs, a foundation tool, reliability exercises,
  dated hiring evidence, and reusable execution and publishing templates.
  Proposed projects are not claims of completed systems or hiring outcomes.
  Third-party quotations and referenced materials retain their own rights.
